{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel wakes up to the same nightmare every night. A girl who will not let him go. When he discovers a missing child report that connects her to his childhood home, he is forced to return to a place filled with unsettling memories and terrifying games he once played with the boy next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a search for truth quickly becomes a descent into blurred memories and creeping dread. The line between reality and nightmare starts to unravel as Daniel pieces together fragments of the past, unsure if he is solving a case or falling deeper into his own delusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror with a focus on story and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting narrative filled with mystery, memory, and fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a childhood home twisted by nightmare logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues through unsettling children\u2019s games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive experience designed to blur the line between dream and reality</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998890?t=1766131439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998890?t=1766131439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998890/78458945e3684e9fe31177e268ddd1f21b6cc0fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766131439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998890/78458945e3684e9fe31177e268ddd1f21b6cc0fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766131439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}